# Floors under Turva's checks: the least each one must report checking.
#
# A check that looks in the wrong place, or is given nothing, still passes,
# so CI also fails when a count falls below its floor here. Each floor is
# at least 90% of the count measured on the date beside it. A successful
# local full lint run raises stale hook floors below 70% of the count.
# CI reports staleness without writing. Explicit refreshes never lower a
# floor; commit increases with the work. Full test runners apply suite floors.
#
# One line per check: <check> <floor>  # how it was set
